kind: llman.sdd.spec
name: "execution-call-by-memoization"
purpose: "TBD - created by archiving change c20-exp-call-by-memoize-field-policy. Update Purpose after archive."
valid_scope[1]: src/scalim/
requirements[4]{req_id,title,statement}:
  r1,"Opt-in ctx-free call_by memoization","当且仅当启用实验性开关时，系统 MUST 对满足条件的 `ctx-free call_by` 派生字段启用“按字段 LRU”记忆化；默认 MUST 关闭。"
  r2,Field allow/deny filter for memoization,系统 MUST 提供字段级过滤策略，使用户可明确选择哪些字段参与 memoization、哪些字段被排除。
  r3,Bounded memory and safe semantics,系统 MUST 为 memoization 提供硬上限，并保持可预测的语义边界。
  r4,Optional performance logging for ROI,系统 MUST 提供实验性日志开关，以 `scalim.performance` 输出 memoization 的聚合统计，用于线上判断 ROI；默认 MUST 不输出。
scenarios[13]{req_id,id,given,when,then}:
  r1,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r1,"disabled-by-default","",未设置 `SCALIM_EXP_CALL_BY_MEMOIZE_MAX_ENTRIES`（或其值为 `0`/负数）,系统 MUST 不启用 `call_by` 记忆化（行为等价于未实现该特性）
  r1,"enabled-only-for-ctx-free-call-by","",设置 `SCALIM_EXP_CALL_BY_MEMOIZE_MAX_ENTRIES` 为正整数,系统 MUST 仅对“不需要 `$ctx` 注入”的 `call_by` 字段启用缓存候选
  r2,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r2,"allow-is-empty-means-allow-all-candidates","",未设置 `SCALIM_EXP_CALL_BY_MEMOIZE_ALLOW`（或解析结果为空）,系统 MUST 将“未被 deny 排除的字段”视为缓存候选
  r2,"allow-restricts-candidates","",`SCALIM_EXP_CALL_BY_MEMOIZE_ALLOW` 解析为非空 patterns 集合,系统 MUST 仅将匹配任一 allow pattern 的字段视为缓存候选
  r2,"deny-overrides-allow","",某字段同时匹配 allow 与 deny patterns,系统 MUST 将该字段排除出缓存候选
  r3,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r3,"per-field-hard-cap","",`SCALIM_EXP_CALL_BY_MEMOIZE_MAX_ENTRIES=N` 且 `N > 0`,系统 MUST 将每个字段的缓存容量上限限制为 `N`（不得无界增长）
  r3,"cache-only-successful-calculator-results-before-transform","","某 `ctx-free call_by` 字段被启用 memoization",系统 MUST 仅缓存 calculator 成功返回的结果
  r4,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r4,"logging-is-opt-in","",未启用 `SCALIM_EXP_CALL_BY_MEMOIZE_LOG_STATS`,系统 MUST 不输出 memoization 聚合统计日志
  r4,"logging-is-privacy-preserving","",启用 `SCALIM_EXP_CALL_BY_MEMOIZE_LOG_STATS`,系统 MUST 仅输出字段级聚合计数/比率等元信息